### MiniWallet Payment Service — API Manual Tests
### REST Client (humao.rest-client) for VS Code / IDE

@host = http://localhost:8080
# Dev JWT token (generate using test or jwt.io with HS256 and dev secret):
@token = PASTE_DEV_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Health & Readiness Checks
GET {{host}}/health

### 1.1 Liveness Probe
GET {{host}}/healthz

### 1.2 Readiness Probe (Checks SQLite DB connectivity)
GET {{host}}/readyz

### 1.3 Prometheus Metrics
GET {{host}}/metrics

### 2. Create Payment (Order amount taken strictly from DB)
# Invariant 1: Amount and currency are taken from DB order, user from JWT.
# Invariant 3: Maximum 1 pending payment per order.
# Invariant 4: IdempotencyKey is required and unique per user.
POST {{host}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: manual-payment-req-001

{
  "order_id": 1
}

### 2.1 Idempotent Replay (Same key returns cached payment)
POST {{host}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: manual-payment-req-001

{
  "order_id": 1
}

### 2.2 Idempotency Conflict (Same key, different payload)
POST {{host}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: manual-payment-req-001

{
  "order_id": 2
}

### 2.3 Missing Idempotency-Key header -> 400
POST {{host}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "order_id": 1
}

### 2.4 Missing Authorization header -> 401
POST {{host}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: unauth-req-001

{
  "order_id": 1
}

### 3. Provider Webhook Notification
# Signature: HMAC-SHA256(timestamp + "." + body, WEBHOOK_SECRET)
# X-Timestamp: Unix timestamp in seconds (within ±5 minutes window)
# X-Signature: Hex-encoded HMAC signature
POST {{host}}/webhooks/provider
Content-Type: application/json
X-Timestamp: 1775376000
X-Signature: PASTE_HEX_HMAC_SIGNATURE_HERE

{
  "event_id": "evt_manual_001",
  "event_type": "payment.succeeded",
  "payment_id": 1,
  "provider_payment_id": "ch_manual_123",
  "amount_minor": 50000,
  "currency": "KZT"
}
